{
  "id": "dakks-ultimate-tokens",
  "title": "Dakk's Ultimate Tokens for Dungeons & Dragons",
  "description": "<p>Unique generated artwork for Dungeons &amp; Dragons in Foundry, and the game compendia that use it, in one module. <strong>Every image</strong> (creatures, races, classes, spells, items, weapons, armor, skills, tables) works in any game system, with <strong>Art Library (All)</strong>, a journal catalogue of every image, including the Dark Sun (Athas) and Theros collections.</p><p><strong>D&amp;D 5e (2014)</strong> worlds also get ready-to-play compendia: the SRD 5.1 monsters, spells, items and character options plus creatures, spells, magic items, subclasses, races, backgrounds and feats from further sourcebooks (rules in our own words), and Theros. <strong>AD&amp;D 2e</strong> worlds on the Advanced Roleplaying System get For Gold &amp; Glory rules, creatures, spells and equipment, Dark Sun and its first campaign, Freedom. Each compendium appears only in worlds of its own system. Every actor carries its painting as portrait and token, with a female or male twin where one is painted.</p><p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Foundry VTT 13 or later (verified on 14.368). The 5e compendia need the D&amp;D 5e system 5.x (tested 5.3.3); the 2e compendia need the Advanced Roleplaying System (tested 2026.08.25) with the ruleset variant set to 2.</p><p>One small script, which only keeps each compendium's folders in their intended order (challenge ratings numerically, Cantrip before 1st Level). Free for personal, non-commercial use; game content under CC-BY-4.0 and the OGL v1.0a as LICENSE.md sets out.</p><p><em>For Gold &amp; Glory™ and FG&amp;G™ are trademarks of Justen Brown. This work is not affiliated with Justen Brown.</em></p>",
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "authors": [
    {
      "name": "TheDakk"
    }
  ],
